@booking_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180
@guestToken = paste-checkout-token-here
@requestId = web-11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Active prices; references are opaque and case-sensitive
GET {{booking_service_HostAddress}}/api/booking/fares?FlightIds=1&FlightIds=2&Currency=USD
Accept: application/json

### Invalid currency returns validation problem details
GET {{booking_service_HostAddress}}/api/booking/fares?FlightIds=1&Currency=usd

### Start guest checkout (keep returned token secret)
POST {{booking_service_HostAddress}}/api/booking/checkouts

### Recover a committed guest reservation after a lost response (404 if unknown)
GET {{booking_service_HostAddress}}/api/booking/reservations/by-request/{{requestId}}
X-Guest-Token: {{guestToken}}

### Reload the stored contact/passenger-name summary
GET {{booking_service_HostAddress}}/api/booking/reservations/1
X-Guest-Token: {{guestToken}}
